  "columns": [
    "93–97",
    "You castPolymorph, targeting the creature closest to the chosen point of origin. Roll Id4 to determine the target’s new form. On a 1, the new form is aBlack Bear; on a 2, the new form is aGiant Wasp; on a 3–4, the new form is aFrog."
